<title>USA: Clarcor Inc Q3 Aug 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Clarcor Inc Q3 Aug 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKFORD, Ill. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third Quarter	   Nine Months</p>
<p>			   1996	  1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net sales	  $88,925     $71,829    $242,583    $204,444</p>
<p> Cost of sales     64,089	51,349     174,234     146,173</p>
<p>   Gross profit    24,836	20,480	68,349	58,271</p>
<p>Selling and administrative</p>
<p>   expenses	  13,739	10,751	40,560	33,243</p>
<p>Operating profit</p>
<p>			 11,097	 9,729	27,789	25,028</p>
<p>Earnings before income</p>
<p>     taxes	   10,483	 9,336	25,907	24,122</p>
<p> Income taxes	 3,957	 3,450	 9,641	 9,358</p>
<p> Net earnings	 6,526	 5,886	16,266	14,764</p>
<p>Net earnings per common share</p>
<p>			   0.44	  0.40	  1.10	  1.00</p>
<p>Average shares</p>
<p>outstanding 14,873,362  14,813,088  14,854,008  14,793,544</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago period ended September 2, 1995.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
